CommitDate: Wed Oct 7 23:36:16 2026 +0200

    mapper: reconcile self on policy recomputes
    
    Self renders from the same state as peers, so leaving it out of policy
    responses hid an exit node's approved routes until it reconnected.
    
    Fixes #3502
